# =========================================================
# Probe / toolsetter / laser audible feedback
# =========================================================
# Plays beep.mp3 on rising edge of:
#   probe-in           — touch probe, contact toolsetter, laser G38 (M62)
#   laser-beam-broken  — beam block while jogging / capture (M62 off)
#
# Requires: scripts/probe_beep.py, beep.mp3 at config root,
# and an MP3 player (mpg123 preferred; ffplay / gst-play-1.0 also ok).
#
# Disable: comment out HALFILE = probe_beep.hal in ethercat_mill.ini.
# Must load AFTER ethercat_mill.hal (creates probe-in + laser-beam-broken).

loadusr -Wn probe-beep python3 scripts/probe_beep.py

# Readers on existing nets (already drive motion.probe-input / digital-in-03).
net probe-in => probe-beep.trigger
net laser-beam-broken => probe-beep.laser
